  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_grani",
      "name": {
        "en": "Grani’s Badge",
        "zh": "格拉尼证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Grani has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude in preemptive penetration of the battlefield situation so as to secure leeway for deployment.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Vanguard Operator during field operations to exercise Charger responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员格拉尼擅长抢先切入战局争取部署空间\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为先锋干员，行使冲锋手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_grani",
      "name": {
        "en": "Cavalry Policeman Suit",
        "zh": "骑警套装",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_grani",
      "description": {
        "en": "Ever since she obtained this mounted police badge, Grani's been waiting for this day. Not looking for a wallet, not unlocking a door for a citizen who forgot their keys. Today, she's finally gotten an official assignment, doing something the mounted police should do—she's joining in the escort of a criminal.\n'Uhh! Not that I'm saying unlocking things isn't what a police officer should do... just...'\nIt's just that she finally gets to do something she's dreamt of since the beginning.\n\n'We've been attacked by an armed group, and we're low on heads! Division Three requesting backup!'\n'How are you, Division Two? Send two for emergency support! Hold on until HQ get here!'\n'It's Grani's team... She shouldn't be taking assignments like this...'\nThe fleet transporting the convict come to an emergency stop under the sudden attack, and though they're prepared for this, the numbers they're facing still exceed the mounted police's expectations.\nGrani holds a defensive posture behind the escort vehicles, the convict still inside, held by a teammate—they're not letting the door open again under any circumstances, as per code, so no worries about the subject.\nAfter that comes devoting everything to prolong the ceasefire as long as possible, waiting for support.\nBut her superior's words just now get Grani a little mad. She's heard words to that effect more than enough times, yes, but today's her first time on an official assignment, and she thought that was recognition of her ability.\n...Guess it wasn't.\n\n'All you need to do is stay here and defend the vehicle, and wait for us to sort this out.'\nGrani watches her two seniors run in armed against their fire, and they take down one, two... even more of the enemy appears from behind the bunker, shouting 'There's only two of them!' and rushing... her seniors and teammates suddenly fall, they pull their hands from the wounds they were clutching, and Grani sees palms red with blood.\nThe parked fleet creating its own highly useful bunker, Grani conceals within it and launches charge after charge. Her teammates have lost hope until they see her routing the enemy's formation, and they're hauled back into safety one after another by this pint-sized girl. The opposition so much as beats a retreat for the time being.\n\n......\nThe support squads following up take over the task of escorting the convict, and Grani keeps her injured seniors and teammates company on the way to a nearby hospital for treatment.\nBit by bit, she's been changing the way people see her, and though she's never rejected herself, getting the recognition of others is something that pleases her all the same.\nGrani dusts off the badge on her shoulder, a bit of ash stuck to it from the conflict before, and now it glimmers bright.",
        "zh": "从拿到这个骑警警徽开始，格拉尼就在期待着这一天。不是找钱包，不是替忘带钥匙的居民开锁，她今天终于接到一个正式的任务，做一件一个骑警应该做的事——参与押运犯人。\n“啊啊，倒也不是说开锁不是一个骑警该做的事了……只是……”\n只是终于可以做她一开始就梦想着去做的事。\n\n“受到武装小队袭击，人手不足，第三小队请求支援！”\n“二队情况如何？分两个去紧急支援！撑到总部人手来！”\n“是格拉尼那队……她、这种任务就不该找……”\n押送犯人的车队在突如其来的攻击下紧急停下，即便已经做好了准备，但对面的人数还是超出了骑警们的预期。\n格拉尼在押运车背后保持着防守姿势，犯人还在车厢里被队友控制着。按照规矩车内的队友也绝不可能再打开车门，犯人的情况不必担心。\n那接下来，就是尽力拖延停火时间，等待支援。\n只是刚才上司的话让格拉尼有些生气。虽然这类的话语她已经听过太多次，但今天是她第一次接到了正式的任务，格拉尼原以为这是对她能力的认可。\n……原来不是啊。\n\n“你就待在这里守着车，等我们处理好就行了。”\n格拉尼看着自己的两个前辈拿着武器冲着对面射击，他们解决掉了一个、两个……敌人从掩体后面冒出来更多，嘴里叫着“只来了两个！”冲了过来……前辈和队友突然倒下，他们把手从按压着的伤口上拿开，格拉尼看到了满掌的鲜血。\n停下的车队是很好用的掩体，格拉尼躲在其中发起了数次冲锋。队友们没有报以希望，直到他们看到她击溃了敌人的队形，他们被这个娇小的女孩一个个拖回了安全的区域。对面甚至暂时地退避了回去。\n\n……\n后续来支援的小队接过了押送犯人的任务，格拉尼护送负伤的前辈和队友前往了附近的医院接受救治。\n她已经在逐渐改变人们对她的看法了，虽然她从来没有否定过自己，但是得到他人的认可，也是一件令人开心的事。\n格拉尼擦了擦肩膀上的警徽，上面之前沾上了战斗时的灰尘，现在它闪闪发亮。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
